OL,3,GNEWSAReform MSPs accused of racism over
OL,4,Aburka ban debate at Holyrood
OL,5,
OL,6,FReform MSPs have been accused of racism
OL,7,Fafter they tabled a Holyrood debate
OL,8,Fabout banning face-coverings, including
OL,9,Fburkas, from public places.
OL,11,FReform's deputy leader in Scotland,
OL,12,FThomas Kerr, lodged a motion raising
OL,13,Fthe prospect of balaclavas and
OL,14,Freligious face coverings being outlawed
OL,15,Fin public in the interests of public
OL,16,Fsafety.
OL,18,FDuring a debate in the chamber, he
OL,19,Fdescribed burkas as "oppressive" and
OL,20,Fsaid they had "no place in modern
OL,21,FScotland".
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,428,420,260,160,0,100
