OL,3,GNEWSAReform MSPs accused of racism over
OL,4,Aburka ban debate at Holyrood
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirst Minister Swinney said Reform MSPs
OL,7,Fwere seeking to divide communities,
OL,8,Fwhile protesters outside Holyrood
OL,9,Faccused the party of demonising Muslim
OL,10,Fwomen.
